#: includes/Admin/Help.php:141
msgid "Register a service on the `silvertrail_register` action, in a plugin or the theme."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:144
msgid "`group`: `essential`, `preferences`, `statistics`, `marketing` or `external-media`. `silvertrail_register_group()` adds your own."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:145
msgid "`hosts`: embeds from these hosts wait behind a placeholder."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:146
msgid "`handles`: scripts enqueued under these handles wait for consent."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:147
msgid "Keep the config the same on every request. Every visitor is asked again when the set of services changes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:151
msgid "Change a service"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:152
msgid "Register a service again by its ID, with only the fields to change."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:155
msgid "A preset’s ID turns the preset on with its defaults. A tracker needs only its `tag_id`."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:156
msgid "The `silvertrail_config` filter runs last. It edits or removes any service, even one turned on here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:157
msgid "The Services tab marks each preset that code turned on, changed or removed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:161
msgid "Gate a script"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:162
msgid "Give the script the type `text/plain` and the service ID. The browser runs it once the visitor agrees."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:165
msgid "Inline and external scripts keep their order."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:166
msgid "A script that WordPress enqueues needs no change: list its handle under the service’s `handles`."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:170
msgid "Settings in code"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:171
msgid "The `silvertrail_settings` filter sets any setting. A field set in code shows “Set in code” on this page and cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:174
msgid "On this page: `enabled`, `layout`, `bar_position`, `appearance`, `require_choice`, `imprint_page`, `floating_button`, `floating_position`, `records`."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:175
msgid "Only in code: `load_css`, `expiry_months`, `retention_days`, `gpc`, `trail`, `webmcp`, `webmcp_tokens`."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:176
msgid "`wp silvertrail settings` lists each value and where it comes from."
msgstr ""

