#: includes/Admin/Help.php:197
msgid "`docs/styling.md` in the plugin folder is a brief for an AI assistant that writes this stylesheet."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:198
msgid "To change the markup, copy a file from `templates/` into the theme’s `silvertrail/` folder and keep the `data-silvertrail-*` attributes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:202
msgid "Links to the preferences"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:203
msgid "Any link to `#silvertrail` opens the preferences, and so does any element with `data-silvertrail-open`."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:206
msgid "The `[silvertrail_link]` shortcode and the Privacy settings link block print such a link."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:207
msgid "Every page needs such a link, unless the floating button is on."
